<title>USA: Dollar Tree Stores Q3 same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Dollar Tree Stores Q3 same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>NORFOLK, Va. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Quarter	   $110.6	$67.4    + 64.0	+ 4.3</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $298.3     $179.0    + 66.6	 N.A.</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Full company name is		Dollar Tree Stores Inc.</p>
<p>Company added 136 Dollar Bill$ stores in January 1996. The company now has 712 stores in 26 states.</p>
</text>
